msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>By default you will be asked where to put a new Event, Todo or Journal when you create them.</para>"
"<para>For convenience it is also possible to configure a default folder for each of the three data items.</para>"
"<para><note>If the folder list below is empty, you might have to add a calendar source through <interface>%1</interface></note></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Standardwies warrst Du fraagt, woneem Du en nieg Begeefnis, Opgaav oder Daagbook sekern wullt..</para>"
"<para>Du kannst ok en Standardorner för elkeen vun disse dree Datenobjekten fastleggen.</para>"
"<para><note>Is de Orner nerrn leddig, muttst Du wull över <interface>%1</interface> en Kalennerborn tofögen.</note></para>"

